	(text "Raspberry Pi Pico         74HC595 (Outputs)          74HC165 (Inputs)\n-----------------         ----------------           ----------------\nGPIO pin 1 -------------> Data in (SER)\nGPIO pin 2 -------------> Clock (SRCLK) -----------> Clock (CLK)\nGPIO pin 3 -------------> Latch (RCLK)\nGPIO pin 4 ----------------------------------------> Load/Latch (SH/LD)\nGPIO pin 5 <---------------------------------------- Data out (Q7)\n\n                      Q0-Q7 to outputs    Inputs to A-H"
